Package: cube-example-apps
Section: games
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Cube 2.0 example applications
 This package provides the official set of example applications for the
 Cube 2.0 LED-cube system, ported to the new C++20 libcube library.
 .
 Applications included:
  - genetic: Genetic color population simulator
  - cubetestapp: basic line/text drawing test utility
  - breakout3d: multi-player 3D breakout game
  - pixelflow3: joystick-driven particle flow simulation
  - matrixrain: voice/audio-reactive matrix style rain
  - snake: multi-player snake game with joystick/AI steering
  - picture: dynamic PNG loader and scroller
  - imutest: IMU acceleration vector intercept demo
  - pixelflow: IMU gravity fluid flow simulation
  - pixelflow2: high-speed variant of gravity flow simulation
  - rainbow: IMU particle orientation demo
  - portalcube: portal-themed companion/storage/reflection cube visualizer

